## Language

- Code, identifiers, comments, tests, logs, commit messages, branch names, PR titles, the changelog,
  file names, plugin names and skill names: English, always.
- Instructions for AI (this file, skills, tool descriptions): English.
- Conversation: {{conversation_language}}
- Documents: {{docs_language}} (README files, decision records, PR descriptions).
- Text that a skill shows to its user follows that user's language, not this rule.
